{"suttaId":"tha-ap127","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5809,5881],"vripara":"41"},"segments":{"tha-ap127:0.3":"Sammukhāthavikattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap127:1.1":"“Jāyamāne vipassimhi, nimittaṃ byākariṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap127:1.3":"‘Nibbāpayiñca [nibbāpayaṃ ca (sī. syā.), nibbāpayanto (?)] janataṃ, buddho loke bhavissati.","tha-ap127:2.1":"“‘Yasmiñca jāyamānasmiṃ, dasasahassi kampati;","tha-ap127:2.3":"So dāni bhagavā satthā, dhammaṃ deseti cakkhumā.","tha-ap127:3.1":"“‘Yasmiñca jāyamānasmiṃ, āloko vipulo ahu;","tha-ap127:3.3":"So dāni bhagavā satthā, dhammaṃ deseti cakkhumā.","tha-ap127:4.1":"“‘Yasmiñca jāyamānasmiṃ, saritāyo na sandayuṃ [sandisuṃ (sī. syā.)];","tha-ap127:4.3":"So dāni bhagavā satthā, dhammaṃ deseti cakkhumā.","tha-ap127:5.1":"“‘Yasmiñca jāyamānasmiṃ, avīcaggi na pajjali;","tha-ap127:5.3":"So dāni bhagavā satthā, dhammaṃ deseti cakkhumā.","tha-ap127:6.1":"“‘Yasmiñca jāyamānasmiṃ, pakkhisaṅgho na saṃcari;","tha-ap127:6.3":"So dāni bhagavā satthā, dhammaṃ deseti cakkhumā.","tha-ap127:7.1":"“‘Yasmiñca jāyamānasmiṃ, vātakkhandho na vāyati;","tha-ap127:7.3":"So dāni bhagavā satthā, dhammaṃ deseti cakkhumā.","tha-ap127:8.1":"“‘Yasmiñca jāyamānasmiṃ, sabbaratanāni jotayuṃ [jotisuṃ (sī. syā.)];","tha-ap127:8.3":"So dāni bhagavā satthā, dhammaṃ deseti cakkhumā.","tha-ap127:9.1":"“‘Yasmiñca jāyamānasmiṃ, sattāsuṃ padavikkamā;","tha-ap127:9.3":"So dāni bhagavā satthā, dhammaṃ deseti cakkhumā.","tha-ap127:10.1":"“‘Jātamatto ca sambuddho, disā sabbā vilokayi;","tha-ap127:10.3":"Vācāsabhimudīresi, esā buddhāna dhammatā’.","tha-ap127:11.1":"“Saṃvejayitvā janataṃ, thavitvā lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap127:11.3":"Sambuddhaṃ abhivādetvā, pakkāmiṃ pācināmukho.","tha-ap127:12.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ buddhamabhithomayiṃ;","tha-ap127:12.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, thomanāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap127:13.1":"“Ito navutikappamhi, sammukhāthavikavhayo;","tha-ap127:13.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap127:14.1":"“Pathavīdundubhi nāma [duddasi nāma (ka.)], ekūnanavutimhito;","tha-ap127:14.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap127:15.1":"“Aṭṭhāsītimhito kappe, obhāso nāma khattiyo;","tha-ap127:15.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap127:16.1":"“Sattāsītimhito kappe, saritacchedanavhayo;","tha-ap127:16.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap127:17.1":"“Agginibbāpano nāma, kappānaṃ chaḷasītiyā;","tha-ap127:17.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap127:18.1":"“Gatipacchedano nāma, kappānaṃ pañcasītiyā;","tha-ap127:18.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap127:19.1":"“Rājā vātasamo nāma, kappānaṃ cullasītiyā;","tha-ap127:19.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap127:20.1":"“Ratanapajjalo nāma, kappānaṃ teasītiyā;","tha-ap127:20.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap127:21.1":"“Padavikkamano nāma, kappānaṃ dveasītiyā;","tha-ap127:21.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap127:22.1":"“Rājā vilokano nāma, kappānaṃ ekasītiyā;","tha-ap127:22.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap127:23.1":"“Girasāroti nāmena, kappesītimhi khattiyo;","tha-ap127:23.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap127:24.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap127:25.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sammukhāthaviko thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap127:26.1":"Sammukhāthavikattherassāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2913,"to":2913,"paras":[{"para":2913,"vripara":"41","refs":["tha-ap127:1"],"words":["jāyamāne vipassimhī","byākariṃ","jāyamāne","nimittaṃ","vipassimhi"],"lines":["So attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>jāyamāne vipassimhī</b>tiādimāha.","<b>Vipassimhi</b> sammāsambuddhe <b>jāyamāne</b> uppajjamāne mātukucchito nikkhante ahaṃ pātubhūtaṃ <b>nimittaṃ</b> kāraṇaṃ buddhabhāvassa hetuṃ <b>byākariṃ</b> kathesiṃ, anekāni acchariyāni pākaṭāni akāsinti attho.","Sesaṃ vuttanayānusārena suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap127:1"],["tha-ap127:1"],["tha-ap127:1"]]}]},"tika":null}
